\par\par \b \uc2 SCHEDULE-Asia Business News at 0500 GMT.   \b0\par\par\uc2 852 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Februar 2004\par 06:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Editor: Ramthan Hussain\par     Telephone: +65 6870 3825\par     All times GMT.\par     TOP STORIES:\par     SINGAPORE - Dollar at two-week low on doubts over G7\par support\par     TOKYO - Japan's Shinsei Bank set to announce IPO\par  SEOUL - Kookmin set to post third straight quarter of loss\par     TAIPEI - TSMC sees firm January revenues, dips from\par December\par     SINGAPORE - Doubts that the Group of Seven nations will act\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 to support its warning against "excess volatility" send the   \f28 \par \par \uc2 dollar to a two-week low against the euro and dash Japanese   \par \par \uc2 stock market hopes for a weaker yen (MARKETS-GLOBAL (WRAPUP 5),   \par \par \uc2 expect by 0700, by Richard Baum, 800 words)   \par \par \uc2 SEE ALSO: (MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 3)   \par \par \uc2 TOKYO - While there was something for everyone in the Group   \par \par \uc2 of Seven statement on \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  can claim its massive   \par \par \uc2 dollar-supporting \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been vindicated, analysts   \par \par \uc2 say. (MARKETS-G7-YEN, expect by 0500, by Daniel Bases, 700   \par \par \uc2 words)   \par \par \uc2 Boca Raton, Fla. - G7 finance ministers and central   \par \par \uc2 bankers agreed after a two-day meeting that "excess   \par \par \uc2 volatility'" and "disorderly movements"' in exchange rates were   \par \par \uc2 undesirable, a coded way of implying the dollar's fall against   \par \par \uc2 the euro may have gone far enough, winning early credit for   \par \par \uc2 crafting a compromise to keep the sensitive issue from flaring   \par \par \uc2 into a public dispute (GROUP-DOLLAR, moved at 0215, by Glenn   \par \par \uc2 Sommerville, 670 words)    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     SEE ALSO: GROUP-\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCY\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (ANALYSIS), moved at 0308, by Mike\par Dolan and John Parry, 800 words)\par     SINGAPORE - The G7 increasingly sees Asia as key to ironing\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 out global economic imbalances, yet the absence of China in   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 particular from the top table of global policy-making is   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 reducing the clout of the group's statements and strategies   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (GROUP-ECONOMY-CHINA (ANALYSIS), expect by 0800, by Alan   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Wheatley, 800 words)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 BEIJING - China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 regulator deny a weekend report that the tightly controlled   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 yuan \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  might be allowed to rise by up to five percent   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 next month (FINANCIAL-CHINA-YUAN (UPDATE 2), expect by 0630,   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 about 500 words)    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     - - - -\par     COMPANIES\par     TOKYO - Shinsei Bank, the first Japanese bank owned by\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 foreign investors, is set to announce Japan's biggest initial   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 share offering since July 2003 ahead of a planned stock   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 exchange listing on February 19 (FINANCIAL-JAPAN-SHINSEI   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (UPDATE 2), expect by 0900, by Chikako Mogi, 600 words)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TAIPEI - Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co, the world's   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 largest contract microchip maker, expected to post strong   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 January revenues but show a slight decline from December amid   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the semiconductor industry's slowest season of the year   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (TECH-TAIWAN-TSMC (UPDATE 1), expect by 0630, by Michael   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Kramer, 350 words)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SEOUL - South Korea's Kookmin Bank poised to report a loss   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 for the third straight quarter, hit by high provision costs   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 stemming from its exposure to LG Card Co and its own card   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operation\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (FINANCIAL-KOREA-KOOKMIN (UPDATE 1), expect by 0730,   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 by Kim Yeon-hee, 500 words)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TOKYO - Japanese electronics parts maker Murata   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Manufacturing and Yamaha Corp, a maker of sound synthesiser   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 chips and musical instruments, are expected to post strong   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 profits for the latest quarter, spurred by robust demand for   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 mobile phone components. (TECH-JAPAN-MURATA (UPDATE 2), expect   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 by 0830, by Kiyoshi Takenaka, 600 words)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TOKYO-Japan's Nikon Corp is set to post a profit for the   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 nine months to December as brisk sales of digital cameras help   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 offset the firmer yen and sluggish demand for film cameras   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (TECH-NIKON (UPDATE 2), expect by 0930, by Nathan Layne, 600   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 words)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MELBOURNE-Edison Mission Energy, a unit of   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 California-based Edison International, has started seeking   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 buyers for its sprawling international power generation   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 portfolio, with indicative bids due mid-to-late March   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (UTILITIES-AUSTRALIA-EDISON, expect by 0700, by Joanne Collins,   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 600 words)    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     - - - -\par     MARKETS/ECONOMY\par     CANBERRA - Australia's free trade agreement with the United\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 States will bring little benefit to the country after the deal   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 failed to live up to expectations on agriculture, analysts and   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 economists say (TRADE-AUSTRALIA-USA (UPDATE 1), expect by 0730,   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 by Michelle Nichols, 600 words)    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     SEE ALSO: TRADE-AUSTRALIA-USA-FARM, expect by 0600, by\par Michael Byrnes, 600 words)\par     BEIJING - China will probe lending to the red-hot steel,\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 cement and property industries and could make it tougher to   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 start new projects to head off overcapacity it fears could   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 derail the strong economy (ECONOMY-CHINA (UPDATE 1), expect by   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0800, by Scott Hillis, about 600 words)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TOKYO - Growth in Japanese money supply remains slow in   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 January and bank lending continues to decline amid sluggish   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 private sector demand, despite growing signs of economic   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 recovery (ECONOMY-JAPAN-BOJ (UPDATE 1), moved at 0223, by   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Tamawa Kadoya, 590 words)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SYDNEY - Australia's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  signals that interest   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 rates may still need to rise further to cope with a credit boom   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 and longer-term inflationary pressures (ECONOMY-AUSTRALIA-MPS   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (UPDATE 2), expect by 0600, by Miranda Maxwell, 600 words)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SEOUL - South Korea's sluggish domestic consumption is not   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 a decisive factor in deciding the country's sovereign ratings,   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 since it is being balanced by robust exports, a senior official   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 at Moody's Investors Service says (ECONOMY-KOREA-MOODYS   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (INTERVIEW), moved at 0330, by Oh Jung-hwa, 500 words)   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - ~- --.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040209e029000sj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
