\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  MOF Sold Y5.88T In Oct-Dec  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 389 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Februar 2004\par 00:50\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent Y5.88 trillion in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the fourth quarter of 2003 in an effort to cap the yen's rise against the dollar, the Finance Ministry said Friday.  \par \par \uc2 The entire amount was used to buy dollars.  \par \par \uc2 The data underscore the ministry's resolve to prevent a strengthening yen from hurting the nation's export-led economic recovery.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  were carried out on 26 separate days, the ministry said.  \par \par \uc2 The biggest amount spent for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on any single day was on Dec. 10, when the MOF spent Y1.28 trillion.  \par \par \uc2 The October-December total was the second largest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  amount for a single quarter, following Y7.551 trillion spent in July-September, a Finance Ministry official briefing reporters said.  \par \par \uc2 The ministry spent Y4.612 trillion in the April-June quarter and Y2.387 trillion in January-March.  \par \par \uc2 That brings the total amount the ministry spent buying dollars for yen to Y20.43 trillion in 2003, far above the previous record of Y7.64 trillion in 1999.  \par \par \uc2 The Y1,283.8 billion spent on Dec. 10 was the fourth largest single-day yen-selling, dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on record, the official added.  \par \par \uc2 Tokyo may be criticized for the huge \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  amount when finance ministers and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  heads of the Group of Seven leading industrial nations get together in Boca Raton, Florida, for a two-day meeting that kicks off later Friday.  \par \par \uc2 The chart below shows the amount spent on dollars in each \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Date                     Amount   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Oct. 1 Y299.8 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 2 Y333.2 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 7 Y283.1 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 9 Y344.6 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 10 Y54.9 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 13 Y140.4 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 14 Y31.0 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 28 Y10.8 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 29 Y158.5 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 30 Y12.4 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Nov. 10 Y366.5 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 11 Y142.5 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 14 Y3.8 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 18 Y21.6 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 19 Y948.7 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 20 Y104.0 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 21 Y100 Mln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Dec. 8 Y87.6 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 9 Y291.4 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 10 Y1.284 Tln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 11 Y104.9 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 12 Y292.5 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 26 Y191.7 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 29 Y172.5 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 30 Y37.1 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 31 Y158.1 Bln  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Leika Kihara, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; leika.kihara@dowjones.com  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by John Gibson and Alastair Gale  \f28 \par \par \uc2 4147  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040205e025000yc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
