\par\par \b \uc2 WRAP:Japan Says G7 Agree On  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  But Market Not So Sure  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Takashi Nakamichi  \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES  \par \uc2 690 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Februar 2004\par 08:27\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--In an apparent attempt to quash market speculation that its Group of Seven partners aren't pleased with \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , top \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials in Tokyo said Tuesday the G7 shares the same view on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 They also indicated that they won't back away from yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  ahead of a G7 meeting of finance ministers and central bankers Friday and Saturday.  \par \par \uc2 Furthermore, a senior finance ministry official said on condition of anonymity that the G7 meeting would be discussing the dollar's weakness.  \par \par \uc2 Despite the remarks, market participants say that they still expect those gathering in Boca Raton, Florida, to differ on this topic, and that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  may receive an unofficial warning not to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  further.  \par \par \uc2 Finance Minister Sadakazu Tanigaki said his \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  team will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if rates swing sharply, adding that G7 countries have a common stance on exchange rates.  \par \par \uc2 "There is a general agreement that (\b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) ought to reflect fundamentals and be stable," Tanigaki said.  \par \par \uc2 His top \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  point man, Zembei Mizoguchi, echoed those comments, saying Europe shares Tokyo's dislike of volatile exchange rates.  \par \par \uc2 "Europe, which is also in the middle of structural reform, is saying stability in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates is necessary to keep its economies stable," said Mizoguchi, the vice finance minister for international affairs.  \par \par \uc2 "In view of this, there will likely be no difference in the general framework (in the G7 meeting)," he said.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Expected To Slow This Week \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 But some market players doubt G7 ministers will agree with Tanigaki and Mizoguchi about exchange rates, or that Europe will be happy to give \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  a green light to continue its yen-selling \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Tanigaki said G7 nations agree on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , but that's probably not the case," said Naomi Fink, senior \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  analyst at BNP Paribas in Tokyo. "Other G7 officials may be voicing calls for stability in exchange rates, but they are talking about different things when they say stability."  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Japanese officials mean a yen weak enough not to hurt exporters, while stability to Europe means a euro that doesn't move violently. To the U.S., stability means a dollar strong enough to lure foreign investors into bonds and stocks, she added.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The remarks from Mizoguchi and Tanigaki won't alter perceptions within financial markets that Japan is slowing the pace of its yen-selling this week and will stop \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  during the G7 meeting, Fink said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Market participants Monday speculated that the Bank of Japan, on behalf of the MOF, was selling yen. But the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had no significant impact on the dollar-yen exchange rate and appeared mostly a smoothing \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operation\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rather than an attempt to drive the dollar higher.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The dollar hit its lowest level since September 2000 Tuesday of Y105.36 and in Asian trading Wednesday stuck in a tight band just above that level.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 At 0700 GMT, it was quoted at Y105.50.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par       Europe May Complain To \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  About \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 Expectations that European officials will complain unofficially about \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's recent \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  during the G7 meeting are likely discouraging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from large-scale yen sales, Fink said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "There is a possibility that European officials will warn \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (against \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ), though they probably won't put it in an official communique," Fink said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A Japanese MOF official later told reporters that the G7 officials would discuss the large fluctuations in non-dollar \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and the dollar's weakness since they last met in Dubai last September.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "As the G7 maintains the view that large \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market fluctuations are undesirable, the issue (of dollar weakness) will be discussed in this context (of excess volatility)," he said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Japan maintains that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates should reflect fundamentals, and if there are excessive movements, it will take appropriate action.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "There is no change in our stance," the Japanese official said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Takashi Nakamichi, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; takashi.nakamichi@dowjones.com (Miyako Takebe and James Simms contributed to this story.)  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by Hugh Lawson  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040203e0230008k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
